hub.com/users/ze2j","html_url":"https://github.com/ze2j","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T17:20:42Z","updated_at":"2025-12-20T17:20:42Z","body":"@HolonProduction I don't know in the general case, but in this particular case nothing prevents it AFAIK. TBH I never tried to unload a GDExtension from an exported game. This may deserve some additional tests to ensure it works, otherwise I would have to revert the unloading part of this PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677973034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3743719842","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105319#issuecomment-3743719842","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105319","id":3743719842,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fJKGi","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers",